Package: nimbusos-docker-keyring
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Docker CE repository key for NimbusOS
 Docker's public OpenPGP key, which signs Docker's official Debian
 repository. The NimbusOS Docker source
 (/etc/apt/sources.list.d/docker.list) names this keyring in signed-by,
 so apt trusts it for Docker's repository only.
 .
 Shipping the key in a package means a Docker key rotation reaches
 installed systems as a normal NimbusOS update.
